### create team 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImlhdCI6MTc4Mjg5MzU2NywiZXhwIjoxNzgyODk0MTY3fQ.RSCBUh7ImoXLqvTuDAocLee47exwY2sxFMVHEKNSJmQ
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "teamName": "test",
    "description": "this team is to test the code"
}

